Package: finalproject
Title: project code and narrative
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person("Jeremiah Paul", "Gorremuchu",
           email = "jeremiah_gorremuchu@hsph.harvard.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides public health datasets for the BST 260 final project.
    Includes CDC data on waterborne and foodborne illness events, homicide
    rates, and firearm mortality, along with RAND firearm legislation data.
    Supplies documentation and a website to support exploration of these data.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/Jeremiah-PG/finalproject,
    https://jeremiah-pg.github.io/finalproject/
BugReports: https://github.com/Jeremiah-PG/finalproject/issues
